/* ---- Motion: the panels and rows cross over instead of snapping --------------------------------

   The house curve is cubic-bezier(.22,.8,.28,1) at 140-180ms: quick enough to feel like a response

   rather than a wait, and eased so nothing starts or stops abruptly. Everything here is decoration —

   the reduced-motion block at the end switches all of it off. */

