/* New-chat hero mark, the settings picker that chooses it, and the Codex mark's click animation. */

.cg-hero-mark { display: block; color: inherit; }

/* Lifted clear of the slot's own box, and the lift is repeated in every keyframe of the click

   animation: that animation writes `transform`, so a static translate here would be overwritten the

   moment the mark is clicked and the icon would drop back down mid-animation. The mark is also not

   focusable (see the component), so a click cannot draw a focus ring around it. */

